  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Get ready to start special scanning!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470065007400200072006500610064007900200074006F0020007300740061007200740020007300700065006300690061006C0020007300630061006E006E0069006E0067002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Special?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300700065006300690061006C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scanning?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300630061006E006E0069006E0067003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, let me explain.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou know how pockets of Hyperspace Lumiose\nare still appearing?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some of ’em are unlike any we’ve seen so far!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006D00650020006F0066002020190065006D002000610072006500200075006E006C0069006B006500200061006E00790020007700652019007600650020007300650065006E00200073006F0020006600610072002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So we developed a system to locate distortions\nthat lead to these new pockets of hyperspace.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe call it...the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>special scan<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> system!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I say “we,” but it was the fine eggheads at\nQuasartico who did the developing.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When we run a special scan, it should pinpoint a\nrare distortion that leads to an unknown pocket<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof Hyperspace Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But the system’s not quite ready—which is why I\nneed you.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGo do some hyperspace survey tasks so we can\nget enough data to run a special scan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Take care of some hyperspace tasks so we’ll have\nenough data to finish the special scan system!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your hard work is much appreciated.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500720020006800610072006400200077006F0072006B0020006900730020006D007500630068002000610070007000720065006300690061007400650064002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve now gathered enough data to fulfill the\nboss’s request.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019007600650020006E006F007700200067006100740068006500720065006400200065006E006F0075006700680020006400610074006100200074006F002000660075006C00660069006C006C0020007400680065000A0062006F007300732019007300200072006500710075006500730074002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please come back to Mr. Corbeau’s office.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C006500610073006500200063006F006D00650020006200610063006B00200074006F0020004D0072002E00200043006F00720062006500610075201900730020006F00660066006900630065002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good work out there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006400200077006F0072006B0020006F00750074002000740068006500720065002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me just plug that data you gathered into the\nsystem...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020006A00750073007400200070006C00750067002000740068006100740020006400610074006100200079006F007500200067006100740068006500720065006400200069006E0074006F0020007400680065000A00730079007300740065006D002E002E002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All done! Now we’re finally ready to make\nsomething happen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00200064006F006E006500210020004E006F0077002000770065201900720065002000660069006E0061006C006C007900200072006500610064007900200074006F0020006D0061006B0065000A0073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002000680061007000700065006E002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’re you waiting for? Run a special scan and\nsee if you can find a rare hyperspace distortion!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please talk to me when you’re ready to use the\nspecial scan system.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000740061006C006B00200074006F0020006D00650020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F00200075007300650020007400680065000A007300700065006300690061006C0020007300630061006E002000730079007300740065006D002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excellent!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007800630065006C006C0065006E0074002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "These pockets of Hyperspace Lumiose are so\nelusive, we can’t find ’em without this scan.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo there’s a good chance you’ll find some special\nPokémon in there!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 164
    },
    {
      "displayText": "One thing, though—you’ll have to gather fresh\ndata for each special scan you run.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a lot of work—but hey, it’s you we’re talking\nabout. I know you’re up to the challenge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ll need you to earn more research points by\ngathering data in Hyperspace Lumiose before we<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncan perform another special scan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corbeau asked you to come to his office. Better\nhead over to the Rust Syndicate’s headquarters!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
